.TH BOX 1
.SH NAME
box \- rotating wireframe cube
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/box
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Box
is a port of the TempleOS demo
.BR Demo/Graphics/Box.HC .
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
A red wireframe cube tumbles under an orthographic transform,
composing three independently advancing ZXZ Euler rotations while
its scale pulses between 0.2\(mu and 1.4\(mu, as in the original.
.PP
Pressing any key quits.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/box.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR wm (1)
